WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.577
Jobs to be done says people hire products to make progress in a circumstance.

00:00:04.627 --> 00:00:08.650
Every job has a functional, an emotional and a social side.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:12.076
Early morning commuters were buying thick milkshakes.

00:00:12.126 --> 00:00:13.527
Not for the taste.

00:00:13.577 --> 00:00:14.801
A shake made a long,

00:00:14.851 --> 00:00:16.204
boring drive interesting,

00:00:16.254 --> 00:00:18.453
and kept them full until lunch.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:24.437
So the real competitors were bananas, bagels and boredom, not other milkshakes.

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:26.309
Use it like this:

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:27.996
write the job in one sentence,

00:00:28.046 --> 00:00:29.576
name the surprising rivals,

00:00:29.626 --> 00:00:31.859
and do that job better.
